    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Founded in 1890, Piedmont remained unincorporated for nearly 117 years before officially becoming a city in August 2007.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piedmont%2C_South_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Piedmont is located in part of the Red Valley, a rock layer in the Spearfish Formation that forms a valley circling the Black Hills.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piedmont%2C_South_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The landscape around Piedmont consists mostly of red shale with beds of gypsum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
